{"id":"vod_sn_38636","vodId":"38636","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"暗夜魔法使","name_cn":"暗夜魔法使","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/b7b018b5ae53d9a230ebf9657696599e.jpg"},"summary":"《暗夜魔法使》（Night Wizard》，是2002年由Enterbrain出版的Table-talk角色扮演遊戲，作者为F.E.A.R.的菊池たけし。2007年10月又发行了第二版规则书。　　本作以现代社会为舞台，描写暗中守护世界的魔法使们的活跃，是带有轻小说风格的Low Fantasy属作品。其世界设定的氛围，受到Alice Soft的游戏《夜が来る!》的强烈影响。像Gunner's Broom、Witch Blade这样的机械式魔法之帚，成为了该作的标志性物品。　　此游戏通过在与TRPG无关的杂志上连载官方Replay，启用声优在Net Radio上发布情报等手段，逐渐聚集了不小的人气。其派生作品有PC上与之同名的成人游戏，以及预定2008年在PS2上发售的AVG游戏。《Fami通PLAYSTATION 》自2007年6月号开始也连载此作相关漫画《Variable Witch》。　　由Hal Film Maker制作，衔接第一版与第二版的动画，于2007年10月开始放送。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:03:17","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/A0X4PNbyKC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9Fey6t6TTG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JAeb66CnkU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YhYevtrbrp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/g0aRtLtAyt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YTbvDaQUZu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Jv1qcbMrxq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bpE0S8mZ5F1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0PTRbuQeBm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nGN6kyq1Sn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JCXWQwFaQN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EFHK448Cx01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"